WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.636
Meet Recordly.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.100
[Recorded microphone test; voice altered for privacy]

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.807
Keep recording as you switch to your game.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.879
Tap the edge controls. Choose your microphone,
supported game audio, or both.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:25.226
Turn on your camera while you record. We have
replaced the camera view with a character for
privacy.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:32.959
Change audio any time. Switch to your mic, mute
it, or turn both sources back on.

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:37.447
Recording stays active in your notifications.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.684
Back to your game. You are still recording.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.721
Recordly. Your screen, your sound, your moment.
